 * @postconditions The returned expression is the last one in the forall header, or 0 if the list is empty or ends with an assignment operation.
 *
 * @note This function uses the ROSE library's SageInterface and AstHandling mechanisms to manipulate and analyze the abstract syntax tree (AST) of the input statement.
 *
 * @example This example demonstrates how to use this function:
