 * This function takes a SgForStatement (a ROSE AST node representing a C/C++ for loop) 
 * as input and normalizes the loop's increment statement. The normalization process
 * involves converting different forms of increments into a standard form, i.e., 
 * either "i += 1" or "i += -1". This is done to facilitate further analysis or transformation.
 *
 * @param loop A pointer to the SgForStatement node representing the for loop to be normalized.
