 */
/**
 * @fn SgProject* SageInterface::getProject()
 *
 * @brief Retrieves the project node from the abstract syntax tree.
 *
 * This function returns a pointer to the project node in the AST. The project
 * node is the root of the AST and represents the entire source code file.
