/**
 * @fn void SageInterface::prependStatementList(const std::vector<SgStatement*>& stmts, SgScopeStatement* scope)
 *
 * @brief Prepends a list of statements to the beginning of a scope statement.
 *
 * This function takes in a vector of statements and prepends them to the beginning
 * of a given scope statement. The function iterates over the input statements in
 * reverse order and calls prependStatement for each one, effectively adding them
 * to the front of the scope statement.
 *
 * @param stmts A vector of SgStatement pointers representing the list of statements to be prepended.
 *             Must not be empty or contain null elements.
