/**
 * @fn void SageInterface::insertStatementAfter(SgStatement *targetStmt, SgStatement* newStmt, bool autoMovePreprocessingInfo /*= true*/)
 *
 * @brief Inserts a statement after the target statement in the AST.
 *
 * This function inserts a new statement (newStmt) after an existing statement 
 * (targetStmt) in the Abstract Syntax Tree (AST). The insertion is performed 
 * by calling the insertStatement() function with the specified parameters. 
 * If autoMovePreprocessingInfo is true, preprocessing information will be 
 * automatically moved to the newly inserted statement.
