 *
 * @pre The targetStmt and newStmt parameters must not be NULL, and the targetStmt must exist in the AST.
 * @post The new statement (newStmt) has been inserted after the target statement (targetStmt) in the AST. If autoMovePreprocessingInfo is true, preprocessing information has been moved to the newly inserted statement.
